  m_Text: This happens when device is unable to get GPS lock, wait for 2-3 minutes
    after turning device ON to get GPS lock. Metallic interference and bad weather
    can also cause problem in getting GPS lock. Also make sure Map is properly callibrated
    and device is not outside the callibrated field
